  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-element-insertadjacenthtml invokes https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#get-trusted-type-compliant-string-algorithm which may throw.\r\n\r\nOther methods: potentially all taking `TrustedHTML`, `TrustedScript`, or `TrustedScriptURL` as arguments. E.g. https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-range-createcontextualfragment.\r\n\r\nA correction would be to add a step \"If the algorithm threw an error, rethrow it and abort the following steps\". All callers would need to be checked too.\r\n\r\nCC @lukewarlow ",
